    ".opencode/plugin/lisa-parity-safety-net.ts": "legacy: the OpenCode adapter for the parity-safety-net hook, retired to a no-op in CodySwannGT/lisa#4672 and no longer shipped from CodySwannGT/lisa#4803. Removed only while byte-identical to a shipped version and unreferenced",
    "scripts/lisa-scratch-run.sh": "legacy: the Rails scratch supervisor (CodySwannGT/lisa#3335, #4371, #4372) that wrapped the pre-push and CI RSpec and mutation routes, retired in CodySwannGT/lisa#4603 in favour of the start-of-run cleanup sweep; the Lisa-managed lefthook.yml and quality-rails.yml no longer call it. Removed only while byte-identical to a shipped version and unreferenced"
  },
